{"3595410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "REday -1", "steam_appid": 3595410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reday -1 – Detective in a time loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet Siberia, 1967.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blizzard interrupts a young scientist's journey to the uranium mines. He finds himself in a lost hotel called &quot;Ogonyok&quot; (The Little Flame), where time has stopped. Each day repeats. Every evening ends in death. And just when it seems there is no way out, reality offers a new hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/4cbee8ccf9190f0c5fdfb97244f1820c.poster.avif?t=1766021908\" width=622 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/4cbee8ccf9190f0c5fdfb97244f1820c.webm?t=1766021908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/4cbee8ccf9190f0c5fdfb97244f1820c.mp4?t=1766021908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thought Mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instead of conventional skills – thinking is your tool. Investigate events, build logical chains, and formulate hypotheses. How you think influences the investigation's progress and changes the main character's personality. You can drive him insane or help him become a true detective. Be his inner monologue.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/0706025921b59beb3532a0e995886f6d.poster.avif?t=1766021908\" width=780 height=221 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/0706025921b59beb3532a0e995886f6d.webm?t=1766021908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Shaping</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your conclusions and perceptions are not just thoughts. They change the main character – his speech, behavior, choices, and even his attitude toward reality. Keep an eye on what you are becoming.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/2673d02f8232f5e41452c6071b373944.poster.avif?t=1766021908\" width=780 height=227 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/2673d02f8232f5e41452c6071b373944.webm?t=1766021908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Time Loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You live the same day over and over again. Do you think we've made a game where you have to complete the same quests because of the time loop? Alas, no. The narrative changes; use the knowledge you've accumulated to dig deeper into the secrets of the &quot;Ogonyok&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/2efe995526c2434b3f7bd2b9beee5301.poster.avif?t=1766021908\" width=780 height=231 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/2efe995526c2434b3f7bd2b9beee5301.webm?t=1766021908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-linear Investigation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is no single path. Every action can reveal a new detail – or lead to an even more tangled version of events that will reveal itself. Or kill you. It all depends on your approach.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/dbe585cda7b06012774d17dea4dc1193.poster.avif?t=1766021908\" width=780 height=223 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/dbe585cda7b06012774d17dea4dc1193.webm?t=1766021908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add the game to your wishlist if you love unconventional stories where death is not the end, but only the beginning.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reday -1 – Detective in a time loop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet Siberia, 1967.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blizzard interrupts a young scientist's journey to the uranium mines. He finds himself in a lost hotel called &quot;Ogonyok&quot; (The Little Flame), where time has stopped. Each day repeats. Every evening ends in death. And just when it seems there is no way out, reality offers a new hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/4cbee8ccf9190f0c5fdfb97244f1820c.poster.avif?t=1766021908\" width=622 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595410/extras/4cbee8ccf9190f0c5fdfb97244f1820c.webm?t=1766021908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steams